  Skill catalog — Plan 550 1d-rest.

  The full body (XML `<available_skills>` block + optional
  `### Skill roots` table + trailing usage line) is produced by
  `formatSkillCatalog(skills)` in `sections/dynamic/skillsMetadata.ts`,
  with the tier (`full` / `compact` / `alias-only`) selected via
  `pickCatalogTier` against the 1500-token budget.

  The .hbs is a thin pass-through: the mapper calls
  `getSkillsMetadataSection(ctx)` synchronously and substitutes the
  result. Empty / omitted sections render `''`, and
  `renderSectionCompute`'s `out === '' ? null : out` collapses that to
  `null`, matching the legacy short-circuit.
